sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Usuario
  participant N as Nova API
  participant S as Nova Scheduler
  participant P as Placement
  participant D as Placement DB
  participant C as Nova Compute
  U->>N: server create
  N->>S: RPC solicitud de scheduling
  S->>P: GET /allocation_candidates (código: 1.36)
  P->>D: consultar inventario/allocations
  D-->>P: candidatos
  P-->>S: allocation_requests + provider_summaries
  S->>P: PUT /allocations/{consumer_uuid}
  P->>D: transacción + generation
  P-->>S: status de claim
  S->>C: RPC construir instancia
  Note over S,P: Pendiente de observar tráfico en DevStack
